# Webapp pattern

- React function components, one component per file, CSS in `src/styles.css` using the existing tokens.
- All HTTP goes through `src/api.ts`. Do not call `fetch` from a page.
- Prices arrive as `priceCents`. Format them with `formatMyr`.
- The PC builder never computes compatibility locally. It posts the selection to `/api/catalog/builder/quote`.
- Keep the gaming theme: dark graphite panels, lime and cyan accents, Chakra Petch headings.
- Do not add a second UI kit. Compose the panels, pills, and buttons that already exist.
